# default-educational-warm (plan section 6): the page at rest at 1440 x 900, density 2, on a light system in
# educational-warm, the mode light as the settings menu would set it. React's first paint settles within
# 1.5 s, so the shot waits 2 s.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme light
mode light
theme educational-warm
wait 2000
shot default
